Rāvaṇa summons ministers and counsels for war --- Rāvaṇa enlists sorcerer Vidyujjihva to fashion illusory head and bow --- Rāvaṇa tells Sītā her husband was slain in night raid --- Rāvaṇa describes Prahasta beheading sleeping Rāma and crushing monkey chiefs --- Vidyujjihva lays false head and bow before Sītā --- Rāvaṇa demands widowed Sītā submit to him